codex_base_instructions.md is a verbatim copy of

    codex-rs/models-manager/prompt.md
    from https://github.com/openai/codex at tag rust-v0.156.1 (the pinned
    Codex; byte-identical to the file at rust-v0.149.1 and rust-v0.153.4)

Copyright OpenAI. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy of the
license is at https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/LICENSE and at
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

The file is the base instructions Codex sends for a model it does not know
(its fallback model entry). OtoDock ships it unchanged inside the per-session
model catalog it writes for a local model (local_model_catalog.py), so that
catalog entry sends exactly what the fallback sends. It is refreshed on every
Codex CLI version bump from the file at the new tag (VERSIONS.md, "To bump a
CLI version"); the file itself carries no header so its length and hash stay
comparable with the upstream file.
